00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:27.960
 otherwise building databases ourselves from the ground up

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:31.960
 that we can then turn into a web application

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.840
 that is not a traditional story

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:36.920
 that people will wanna read and maybe even pay for, right?

