 choosing kind of like the commercial strip

01:12:16.080 --> 01:12:17.800
 and looking at Google Street View

01:12:17.800 --> 01:12:20.440
 and sort of like coding that over time

01:12:20.440 --> 01:12:23.720
 for the main, like the main drags of different neighborhoods.

01:12:25.760 --> 01:12:26.600
 - Yeah.

01:12:26.600 --> 01:12:28.680
 Or even if we did the number for the whole county,

