 and do that closer study on that place.

01:12:34.640 --> 01:12:35.480
 - Yeah.

01:12:35.480 --> 01:12:37.080
 - You know, and then you wouldn't have to do everywhere.

01:12:37.080 --> 01:12:38.200
 - Right.

01:12:38.200 --> 01:12:39.680
 - I also have to think about how to do less.

01:12:39.680 --> 01:12:40.520
 Sorry.

01:12:40.520 --> 01:12:42.280
 (laughing)

